        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions AP-MDS3RDDSBR, Large Pineapple Refrigerator Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Large Pineapple Appliance Handle comes packaged with everything you need to install on an appliance door panel 3/4 inches up to 1 inch thick. Choose from 19 inch or 24 inch lengths in a wide array of finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Madison Pull:\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thru-Bolts</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-MDS03-specifications.pdf?v=1704262247\"><b>First Impressions AP-MDS3RDDSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>AP-MDS3019RDDSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 19-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-3/5\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.63\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AP-MDS3024RDDSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 14\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-3/5\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.63\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This First Impressions pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including different center to center mounting distances and  <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually</i>\r\n</p>",
